    historyContent: {
      origins: 'The origins of Bergen are not definitively known. The name may reference the Norwegian city of Bergen or Bergen op Zoom in the Netherlands, but no confirmed historical connection has been established. It belongs to the broad family of line domino games, likely European in origin.',
      originCountries: [
