    aiContent: {
      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Plays any legal tile. No scoring optimisation — random end selection when multiple legal moves exist.',
        medium: 'Evaluates each move for double header or triple header formation. Prefers moves that score immediately. Holds doubles until a triple header opportunity arises.',
        hard: 'Full tile tracking from opponent draws and plays. Calculates probability of opponent holding tiles that would break a double header. Evaluates blocking strategy when tile count is light. Optimises between scoring now vs. setting up higher-value future plays.',
